1221.description:
The Call of Juarez series boasts an interesting approach to development, and this time the developers have once again delved into the Wild West theme, as it enjoys the greatest success and popularity among fans. But now they've decided to create entirely new heroes with charismatic appearances and colorful stories about their fates. This time, players will take on the role of a bounty hunter who has received a contract to eliminate two of the Wild West's most notorious and powerful gunslingers. The order isn't simple, and completing it will be quite challenging. But our hero isn't one to say no and will happily take it on, as his professionalism and luck allow him to do so. But don't rely solely on your character, as the game is hardcore and realistic, so your marksmanship, agility, and quick reflexes will be essential. Good luck, cowboy!

Game features:
- Get ready to learn the real history of the Wild West and fight the most notorious and elusive criminals of that time, including Jesse James, Billy the Kid and John Hardin;
- an interesting storyline that is filled not only with fierce shootouts and exciting moments, but also with various revelations from defeated opponents;
- the game's wonderful atmosphere allows it to convey the subtle nuances of a time when lawlessness was commonplace and most of the population knew how to shoot accurately with a revolver;
- demonstrate your mastery of various types of weapons, from twin revolvers to lethal rifles. Good shooting will come in handy, since only a well-aimed bullet will allow you to avoid death;
The game features a role-playing system that allows you to improve your shooting skills, from reloading to accuracy and lethality, by achieving special results in completing levels and killing enemies.

